{"4616770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "cursor+cursor", "steam_appid": 4616770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if controlling one character wasn’t enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced arena shooter, you control <strong>two cursors at the same time</strong> - each with its own weapons, stats, and movement. You'll need to dodge enemies, position your cursors wisely... and pick the right mods and upgrades to create the most powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.poster.avif?t=1785760209\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.webm?t=1785760209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.mp4?t=1785760209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic duo:</strong> Control two independent cursors simultaneously in a twin-stick shooter fashion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick play:</strong> Survive through fast runs (~15 minutes).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout experiments:</strong> Test and combine dozens of weapons, items and boosts from one run to the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptative strategy:</strong> Think fast, move well and react cleanly to the ever-more powerful enemies, the increasing constraints and the growing chaos in each new game.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if controlling one character wasn’t enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced arena shooter, you control <strong>two cursors at the same time</strong> - each with its own weapons, stats, and movement. You'll need to dodge enemies, position your cursors wisely... and pick the right mods and upgrades to create the most powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.poster.avif?t=1785760209\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.webm?t=1785760209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4616770/extras/aa1919776d830977452dac30ca6b100c.mp4?t=1785760209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic duo:</strong> Control two independent cursors simultaneously in a twin-stick shooter fashion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick play:</strong> Survive through fast runs (~15 minutes).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout experiments:</strong> Test and combine dozens of weapons, items and boosts from one run to the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptative strategy:</strong> Think fast, move well and react cleanly to the ever-more powerful enemies, the increasing constraints and the growing chaos in each new game.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "cursor+cursor is a fast-paced arena shooter where you don't control one avatar... but two at the same time! Position your pair of cursors wisely to protect your core, upgrade your equipment and create unique builds to survive, all the while enjoying a &quot;minimalist cyberpunk-ish&quot; vibe